      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 17 . It is proved by discussion in point No.1 that the respondent has committed domestic violence against the petitioner and her child."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a3f4c0b4fed240d88fe106fb8c20f26d_145",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondent has paid interim maintenance only after Hon'ble Family Court has passed orders."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8eb4d449c1ac4ff3a0efcb9c56a2f351_146",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There is no straight jacket formula to award maintenance and it is settled principle of law that the status of parties, their earning capacity, their expenses, their dependents, the prevailing market conditions etc have to be taken into con"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8b770cac246140dfa74d1beac0c6415d_147",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the law laid down by the Hon'ble Supreme Court in Rajanesh V/s Neha reported in (2021) 2 SCC 324, the Court has to consider the status of the parties, earning capacity of the parties,\nneeds and expenses of the petitioner, number of d"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a155e17c491b4418af05138569a8149e_148",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Applying these propositions of law, the respondent is directed to pay maintenance of Rs.10,000/- per month towards the maintenance of petitioner and Rs.10,000/- towards Chitra D 8660454326 vs Nandish Kumar on 23 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6aeb014a7cc64c9c9a9ae8b441a19ba2_149",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n9 minor child."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "47dd60874dae45eba20afad17c5bb613_150",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 18. The petitioner has sought for protection order directing the respondent not to interfere with the peaceful life of the petitioner, she has also sought for an order of safety by imposing certain conditions against the respondent from c"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cdcb3832ccca45a4a167101a63b600ca_151",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already stated the petitioner and respondent are not residing together."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "67f488fec61c44ff89f2d9b2e6ce504d_152",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Petitioner has not proved that the respondent has interfered in her life or has threatened her or her minor child's safety after separation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "599919dbfa094f07a6a3cae9ae0b6a6b_153",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, it is not necessary to pass protection order against the respondent."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a168e57de4bb44cba4945a9e62cece92_154",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence,point No.2 answered partly in the affirmative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9911056a26924512a51de71160de52c2_155",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 19. POINT No.3 :- In view of the materials placed before this court, pleadings, deposition and documentary evidence this court proceed to pass the following;\n 17  Crl.Misc.129/2019  ORDER"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cbf6c8c0a5f1463c98abdf093c6c4bfc_156",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petition filed by the petitioner under Sec.12 of The Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act, 2005 as against respondent is allowed in part."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "99b108bc42774590980c0f38fc7b89e5_157",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nRespondent is hereby directed to pay an amount of Rs.10,000/-per month (Rupees ten thousand only) to the petitioner towards maintenance from the date of petition till her life time or till she gets re-married whichever is earlier."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f2c0993980204fa6bfde9f4680543338_158",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
